{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "代理与实现",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 114.12,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.232,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 2.983
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "一个可升级合约，其实是两个合约。",
   "spoken": "一个可升级合约，其实是两个合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.052,
   "dur": 3.48,
   "speechStart": 4.15,
   "speechEnd": 6.697
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "代理合约，保存数据和资金。用户的每次调用，都先到它这里。",
   "spoken": "代理合约，保存数据和资金。用户的每次掉用，都先到它这里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-02.mp3",
   "start": 7.752,
   "dur": 6.144,
   "speechStart": 7.85,
   "speechEnd": 13.05
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "实现合约，只提供代码。",
   "spoken": "实现合约，只提供代码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-03.mp3",
   "start": 14.116,
   "dur": 3.072,
   "speechStart": 14.214,
   "speechEnd": 16.356
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "代理用 delegatecall 把调用转给实现：借用实现的代码，读写的却是代理自己的存储。",
   "spoken": "代理用 delegatecall 把掉用转给实现：借用实现的代码，读写的却是代理自己的存储。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-04.mp3",
   "start": 17.408,
   "dur": 6.48,
   "speechStart": 17.506,
   "speechEnd": 23.053
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "升级，就是让代理指向一个新的实现。",
   "spoken": "升级，就是让代理指向一个新的实现。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-05.mp3",
   "start": 24.108,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 24.206,
   "speechEnd": 26.86
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "数据和资金原地不动，只换代码。",
   "spoken": "数据和资金原地不动，只换代码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-06.mp3",
   "start": 27.928,
   "dur": 3.624,
   "speechStart": 28.026,
   "speechEnd": 30.704
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "所以，谁能换实现，谁就拥有代理里的全部资金。",
   "spoken": "所以，谁能换实现，谁就拥有代理里的全部资金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-07.mp3",
   "start": 31.772,
   "dur": 5.016,
   "speechStart": 31.87,
   "speechEnd": 35.953
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "打个比方。代理是一台售货机的机身，货和钱都在里面。",
   "spoken": "打个比方。代理是一台售货机的机身，货和钱都在里面。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-08.mp3",
   "start": 37.008,
   "dur": 5.304,
   "speechStart": 37.106,
   "speechEnd": 41.46
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "实现是维修门后面的机芯，决定按下按钮以后，机器怎么动。",
   "spoken": "实现是维修门后面的机芯，决定按下按钮以后，机器怎么动。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-09.mp3",
   "start": 42.532,
   "dur": 5.304,
   "speechStart": 42.63,
   "speechEnd": 47.011
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "升级，就是打开维修门，换一块新机芯。",
   "spoken": "升级，就是打开维修门，换一块新机芯。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-10.mp3",
   "start": 48.056,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 48.154,
   "speechEnd": 51.308
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "比喻在这里不成立：真实的机器换机芯要花时间。链上如果没有时间锁，换实现只要一笔交易。",
   "spoken": "比喻在这里不成立：真实的机器换机芯要花时间。链上如果没有时间锁，换实现只要一笔交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-11.mp3",
   "start": 52.356,
   "dur": 8.712,
   "speechStart": 52.454,
   "speechEnd": 60.237
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "常见的代理有三种，区别在于，升级的开关放在哪里。",
   "spoken": "常见的代理有三种，区别在于，升级的开关放在哪里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-12.mp3",
   "start": 61.288,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 61.386,
   "speechEnd": 65.493
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "第一种，透明代理。升级函数在代理里，由管理员调用。",
   "spoken": "第一种，透明代理。升级函数在代理里，由管理员掉用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-13.mp3",
   "start": 66.548,
   "dur": 5.712,
   "speechStart": 66.646,
   "speechEnd": 71.429
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "管理员调用代理时不转发，其他人的调用只转发，两边的函数就不会混淆。",
   "spoken": "管理员掉用代理时不转发，其他人的掉用只转发，两边的函数就不会混淆。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-14.mp3",
   "start": 72.48,
   "dur": 6.48,
   "speechStart": 72.578,
   "speechEnd": 78.113
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "第二种，UUPS。代理只做转发，升级函数写在实现合约里。",
   "spoken": "第二种，UUPS。代理只做转发，升级函数写在实现合约里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-15.mp3",
   "start": 79.18,
   "dur": 6.792,
   "speechStart": 79.278,
   "speechEnd": 85.144
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "风险是，新实现如果忘了带上升级函数，这个合约就再也不能升级。",
   "spoken": "风险是，新实现如果忘了带上升级函数，这个合约就再也不能升级。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-16.mp3",
   "start": 86.192,
   "dur": 6.312,
   "speechStart": 86.29,
   "speechEnd": 91.671
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "第三种，信标代理。很多代理共用一个信标，信标里存着实现的地址。",
   "spoken": "第三种，信标代理。很多代理共用一个信标，信标里存着实现的地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-17.mp3",
   "start": 92.724,
   "dur": 6.768,
   "speechStart": 92.822,
   "speechEnd": 98.641
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "它适合大量相同的合约，比如每个用户一个金库。改一次信标，所有代理一起换。",
   "spoken": "它适合大量相同的合约，比如每个用户一个金库。改一次信标，所有代理一起换。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-18.mp3",
   "start": 99.712,
   "dur": 7.296,
   "speechStart": 99.81,
   "speechEnd": 106.176
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "三种模式都依赖 delegatecall，所以都有同一个风险：存储冲突。",
   "spoken": "三种模式都依赖 delegatecall，所以都有同一个风险：存储冲突。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg2-19.mp3",
   "start": 107.228,
   "dur": 5.688,
   "speechStart": 107.326,
   "speechEnd": 112.064
  }
